==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 7 seconds<sup>210f</sup>, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**7 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==

Send a few fast units to rush the stage, so the Dread Bore appears and burrows.  If done correctly, he should re-appear far enough from your base (around the middle of the stage). Throw everything at it including Zombie crowd controllers like [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]], [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] or [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] to prevent him advancing too fast.  Add [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] or [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]] if you don't have enough slots for multiple meatshields.

